    "name": {
      "value": "Geomancer"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "som"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You know how to draw power from the land around you, no matter the terrain, by attuning your magic to match its mystical properties.\n\nYou might be a druid with an elemental focus (such as the Druid, Druid, or Druid orders) or a naturalist with a touch of magic at your disposal. You could concentrate on a single type of terrain to wring every last drop of power from it or choose to wander the land to experience every type of terrain possible."
    },
